Tag: v1.0.0
Release title: MV-STD-GAN v1.0.0 – EMS submission version

This release corresponds to the code, trained models, partial example data,
and documentation submitted with the manuscript:

“A Unified Multi-Variable Spatiotemporal Downscaling Approach for
High-Resolution Tropical Cyclone Detection Using Deep Learning.”

The release contains the experimental Notebooks, trained models, environment
specifications, partial example data, and documentation used for the
Environmental Modelling & Software submission.
